# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository.
#
# Without this, a contributor on Windows commits CRLF, and the next person on
# macOS or Linux sees every line of a file as changed. It matters more than
# usual here: this project is built on all three operating systems in CI, and
# a stray CRLF in a shell script breaks the Linux job in a way that looks
# nothing like its actual cause.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files git must never convert or attempt to diff as text.
*.png binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.node binary
*.dmg binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.AppImage binary
*.deb binary
